<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia produces 1.60 mln bpd oil in August.</title>
<headline>Indonesia produces 1.60 mln bpd oil in August.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia produced 1.60 million barrels per day (bpd) of crude oil and condensate in August, an industry source said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Indonesia produced around 1.43 million bpd of crude and 170,000 bpd of condensate in August,&quot; the source said.</p>
<p>He said Indonesian crude oil production seem to be stable but condensate output was declining slightly.</p>
<p>The source gave no other details.</p>
<p>--Jakarta newsroom 6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
